.TH MYGREP 1 "September 2026" "MyUtils" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mygrep \- search for a string in a file
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mygrep
.BI "const char *filename, const char *pattern"
.SH DESCRIPTION
The mygrep function searches the specified file for lines
containing the given pattern and reports matching lines.
.SH AUTHOR
Eras Tariq
